WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.202 size:84% position:42%
-Your early acting life
was not even on camera.

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:05.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
You worked at a Ren Faire --
at a Renaissance Faire?

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did, yeah.
-Wow.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.476 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I worked a lot.

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:11.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
Grandma instilled it in me,
so, yeah.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:13.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I had several --
-Did it, like, appeal to you

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:17.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
as an actor, or did it just
appeal to you as a job?

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
-As a job. It did.
-Yeah.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:22.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was always a little --
I loved it.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I always hate
to be critical of people,

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:26.126 line:92%
but I was a little creeped out,

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:31.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I was like 16
and looked like I was 14,

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:33.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was
the cheese-bread wench.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.034 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there were 45-year-old
and older men

00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:40.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
coming up and asking
the tarty wench

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.842
to "fetch them
ye meat pies and cheese bread."

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:46.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like -- So I'd
have to act like "ye wench."

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:47.580 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How does a wench
even fetch bread

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
different than another person?
-I'm not sure.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:53.386
And I really didn't know at 14.
-Yeah. Right.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.121 line:92%
-I could probably swing it now.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:56.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
I could
fetch your cheese bread now.

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:58.725
-You could put a little wench
on it now, but back then...

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now I could --
I could fetch your --

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, I was about
to say something so wrong.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I'm not gonna say it!

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it had to do
with the meat pie.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:07.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's just leave it...
-Gotcha. Let's just let --

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:11.137 size:84% position:42%
And then let your minds
take you to wherever --

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:13.173 align:start size:94% position:6%
wherever it was
that you thought, Amy...

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:14.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do like I stopped myself,
though.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:16.409
-Yeah.
I like that you stopped yourself

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:18.678 size:81% position:41%
and then you gave them
all the information.

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:19.212 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:21.581
You actually made it somehow a
little bit worse than if you --

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A little worse.
-Yeah.

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:23.516 line:92%
-That's kind of what I do.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
I always make things
a little worse for myself.

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:27.287 size:84% position:42%
-Yeah. But, you know,
I will say that I think

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:30.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
that some of those, you know,
45-year-old guys

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
who remember you
as the cheese wench,

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:33.860 size:84% position:42%
they're home right now,
they're so much older,

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.495 size:81% position:41%
and they saw that joke
you were gonna make,

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:37.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it made them happy.
-I'm glad.

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:38.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I'm glad.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:42.535
If a joke about meat pie
can bring some Christmas joy...

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:43.303 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:45.772
-They're like,
"Oh, our wench is all grown up!"

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.640 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

